          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 6 · Q2",
          "passageTitle": "Quotation — Q2",
          "passage": "The Underdogs is a 1915 novel by Mariano\nAzuela, originally written in Spanish. In the\nnovel, the town of Juchipila is depicted as a\nstriking sight for a group of soldiers as they view\nit from afar:____________",
          "prompt": "Which quotation from a translation of The\nUnderdogs most effectively illustrates the claim?",
          "options": [
