          "passage": "A student is writing a research paper on the\nhistory of irrigation in the United States,\nsituating the development of Hume Lake\n(created in Fresno County, California, in 1908)\nin a larger historical context. The student\nclaims that California's climate renders\nirrigation an essential component of agriculture\nin some parts of the state but not in others.",
