          "passageTitle": "Quotation — Q27",
          "passage": "The Underdogs is a 1915 novel by Mariano\nAzuela, originally written in Spanish. In the\nnovel, Azuela depicts a traveling group of\nsoldiers as having a renewed sense of agency and\nauthority as they set off on a new stage of their\njourney: __________.",
          "prompt": "Which quotation from a translation of The\nUnderdogs most effectively illustrates the claim?",
          "options": [
