          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 6 · Q42",
          "passageTitle": "Quotation — Q42",
          "passage": "Poems is an 1895 collection of poetry by Frances\nE.W. Harper. In one of Harper's poems, the\nspeaker criticizes activists who champion\nhumanitarian causes in other countries while\noverlooking local concerns, saying",
          "prompt": "Which quotation from Poems most effectively\nillustrates the claim?",
          "options": [
