          "skill": "Quotation",
          "domain": "Information and Ideas",
          "focus": "Select the quotation that most effectively illustrates or supports the claim",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 6 · Q43",
          "passageTitle": "Quotation — Q43",
          "passage": "In a paper for an art history class, a student\nclaims that Rosa Bonheur's 1855 painting The\nHorse Fair marks a significant change in\nBonheur's artistic development.",
          "prompt": "Which quotation from an art history textbook\nwould most effectively support the student's\nclaim?",
          "options": [
