          "passageTitle": "Quotation — Q68",
          "passage": "\"Aunt Sue's Stories\" is a 1926 poem by\nLangston Hughes. In the poem, the speaker\nindicates that the stories Aunt Sue tells are\nbased on Aunt Sue's personal experiences,\nsaying that",
