          "passage": "The Wonderful Wizard of Ozis a 1900 novel by\nL. Frank Baum. In the novel, Dorothy lives in\nKansas with her aunt and uncle, but she later\nfinds herself in a land called Oz. The narrator\nindicates that her aunt and uncle's house in\nKansas is remote and solitary, writing that",
